      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-FLOOD-NPC02-I_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "And of course she's gone. You should have captured her, Wizard! I could have led us out of that Akashic thing.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_WitchF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Baba_Yaga_AH-FLOOD_104.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752125,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-FLOOD-NPC02-I_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Yes... well... what is done is done. All we can hope is Miranda did not acquire what she sought.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Qismah_Shasa_AH-FLOOD_064.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752090,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-FLOOD-NPC02-I_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "She didn't. No access point, no records, no finding anything. Savvy?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/TurtleFanatic_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Snaps_AH-FLOOD_007.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752128,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-FLOOD-NPC02-I_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "But these Records are just... records, right? So what did she want to learn from them?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Jackalope_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Jaki_Whisperwind_AH-FLOOD_083.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1791000,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-FLOOD-NPC02-I_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I don't know. She talked about all sorts of stuff... storms and weapons and monsters and curses... she sent us to the ends of the world.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/TurtleFanatic_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Snaps_AH-FLOOD_008.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752128,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-FLOOD-NPC02-I_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "And what precisely do you get from this alliance?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Qismah_Shasa_AH-FLOOD_065.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752090,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-FLOOD-NPC02-I_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Revenge. But, look, you pulled me from the abyss, Briar tried to sacrifice me. So... if you want... I can give you a lift back to your boat.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/TurtleFanatic_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Snaps_AH-FLOOD_009.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752128,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-FLOOD-NPC02-I_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "But I'm not done with this city yet. We searched too long for this world to give up hope already.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/TurtleFanatic_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Snaps_AH-FLOOD_010.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1752128,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AH-FLOOD-NPC02-I_Persona",
